From 761a9caf66c54bdd1eb48b6e7d744192cc6e295b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:27:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Persist worker queue reasons and explicit origin
 repin (#701)

* [daveey] Persist worker queue observations and support explicit origin repin

* [daveey] Keep queue diagnostics non-disruptive across recovery transitions

* [daveey] Report lost repin replies as unknown outcomes

* [daveey] Preserve unknown repin outcome on server errors

* test(kanban): machine metrics key bound includes drain telemetry fields
